lurb where a demon picked out the God Machine things by browsing blogs and waiting for a certain taste to fill her mouth. I'm not above a &quot;something feels off&quot; feeling as a plot hook, but I'd leave it up to the ST when they want to drop the hook..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}